{"id":"vod_sn_37698","vodId":"37698","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"少年犯之七人","name_cn":"少年犯之七人","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/1cbe3aebf6d8890e50aac0fa7fb318bb.jpg"},"summary":"上世纪中叶，漆黑阴森的湘南特别少年院二舍六房迎来了新的住客：因伤害罪和杀人未遂被捕的水上真理雄（小栗旬 配音）、强壮孔武的远山忠义（黒田崇矢 配音）、偷窃欺诈成性的前田升（朴璐美 配音）、有着异国英俊面容的横须贺丈（羽染達也 配音）、酗酒暴力的怪力男松浦万作（脇知弘 配音）以及狡诈精明的野本龙次（藤原啓治 配音）。黑暗的过去，悲伤的童年，让这群少年的未来充满绝望。幸运的是，二舍六房的前辈樱木六郎太（小山力也 配音）担当起教育少年们的责任，在芜杂的战后日本社会以及混乱黑暗的少管所内，樱木带着6名少年朝着光辉的梦想矢志不移前进……　　本片根据安部让二的同名漫画原著改编（漫画家柿崎正澄但当作画）。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5TqXngSQMk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r7nxQMeXnL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iAcaX36esT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0xhij41qvh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zJKjSyQdvr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dKazpqYzUd1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/HP5fnzX8mi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dwaPQP3a2B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zFkN7YYNRJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/i6929QEcpC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BBXuNn7cqk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1raJkHuWe21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hZFHegLhiy1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DjRYpPRi9P1/video/index.m3u8"}